# Student Management System

## Project Description

Student Management System is a Django-based web application used to manage student information.

The system allows the administrator to add, view, edit, delete, and search student records.

## Features

- Add Student
- View Student List
- Edit Student Details
- Delete Student
- Delete Confirmation
- Search Students
- Total Student Count
- Duplicate Email Validation
- Success Messages
- Django Admin Panel

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Django
- HTML
- CSS
- SQLite
- VS Code

